## Available dependencies

Native HTML, CSS, and browser DOM APIs are available. No external packages, React components, remote code, credentials, or configured network services are supplied. Implement browser behavior natively. Missing optional fonts, photos, copy, or destinations do not require an unavailable component conflict: use the draft policy above.

